      <description>黑五 AI 助理挑战赛路演现场，我们的 Agent 实算出一单亏损 $57.85 并当场建议「别打」。本期拆解：为什么确定性算账比讲增长故事更值钱，以及跨境卖家最常见的价格带幻觉。
On stage at the Black Friday AI Assistant Challenge, our agent publicly computed a −$57.85/unit loss and said "don't take it." Why deterministic math beats rosy narratives.</description>
